{
  "about": "A board counts as solved only within the requirement's max_expansions. A level is cleared when every requirement is met (min_solved boards of the suite, default all) and every lower level is cleared. Guide: helpful_text/LEVELS.md",
  "safety_timeout_s": 120,
  "review_us_per_expansion": 2000,
